    <h3 class="mb-20">Hybrid Solar System</h3>

    <p class="mb-20">
        A hybrid solar system combines the benefits of solar panels, battery storage,
        and grid electricity to provide a reliable and efficient power solution.
        At Shail Solar Energy Solutions  , we offer advanced hybrid solar systems designed
        for homes, businesses, and industries. These systems allow you to store
        excess solar energy in batteries and use it when sunlight is not available
        or during power outages.
    </p>

